{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44563","headline":"诗三百三首 二百六十 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二百六十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自羡山间乐，逍遥无倚托。\n逐日食残躯，闲思无所作。\n时披古佛书，往往登石阁。\n下窥千尺崖，上有云盘泊。\n寒月冷飕飕，身似孤飞鹤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}